Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.26,0:00:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.02,0:00:10.56,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.75,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm almost completely healed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.35,0:00:12.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Laojun's medicine helped.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit torn.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you've recovered,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but we'll miss you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.23,0:00:20.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you guys often.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't told Xiaobai yet, have you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.41,0:00:24.08,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How much time do you need?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.61,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I should be ready by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take a human form?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.28,0:00:28.77,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, can I see it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.75,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,It's awkward to transform in front of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you leave tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not rest a bit more?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.71,0:00:38.53,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'd rather finish the quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.93,0:00:39.83,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you after that.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.01,0:00:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, say goodbye to Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.61,0:00:43.12,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.29,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Before I forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.73,0:00:47.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can you lend me some clothes?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.16,0:00:49.23,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I reverted to my base state.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.43,0:00:50.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,My clothes didn't survive.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.19,0:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.89,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Early today morning, an aircraft of\NMT Airlines crashed in Longyou City.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.40,0:01:01.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The passengers were discovered on roofs of houses near the site.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.73,0:01:01.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,0)}{\pos(500,583)}The Lawful and Lawless
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of the baffling phenomenon is under investigation.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.97,0:01:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We interviewed a fortunate survivor.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.18,0:01:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.68,0:01:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day on,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in God's existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank him for saving me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.29,0:01:15.14,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I will cherish my life even more.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.23,0:01:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been a spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Incidents involving spirits are\Non the news 10-20 times a year.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So many?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So few, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.28,0:01:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Many spirits live secluded.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.75,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who live among humans, must hide their identities.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.63,0:01:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from incidents like this,\Nmost of them never get exposed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,The club hall prohibits flying over the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.92,0:01:33.61,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,He'll be punished.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know their rules so well?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.79,0:01:37.63,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I used to live there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.83,0:01:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.02,0:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So every spirit lives in hiding?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.29,0:01:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of them make good use of their abilities in the human world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.90,0:01:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are even rich and famous.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.97,0:01:48.73,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit boards, tabloid section.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.43,0:01:51.11,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.91,0:01:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.91,0:02:04.96,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sunbathe.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.64,0:02:21.64,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.29,0:02:25.23,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I can tell her then.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.60,0:02:35.44,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.83,0:02:36.54,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Always listen to Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.17,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,If you don't behave, they won't keep you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.95,0:02:43.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Good morning, boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.71,0:02:44.23,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.74,0:02:49.81,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I think I heard ex-boss.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.63,0:02:51.61,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Is he on a trip?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.98,0:02:54.68,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,He's having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.29,0:03:04.06,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.53,0:03:11.82,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Boss!!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.88,0:03:20.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.91,0:03:44.45,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.73,0:03:46.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,A lot of our comrades have disappeared.\NWhat if it's...?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.03,0:03:49.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.92,0:04:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.55,0:04:11.34,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.17,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hello, dear! Had breakfast yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who'll be at the door first?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.27,0:04:17.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Me, me, me!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.44,0:04:19.93,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.78,0:04:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're empty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.81,0:04:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they escape?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.43,0:04:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.47,0:04:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.86,0:04:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.21,0:04:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.76,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.96,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.57,0:04:55.51,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.85,0:05:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.61,0:05:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that much for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare I meet someone of my kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me, little fellow,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.03,0:05:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,why do you want to save a human like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits, humans, animals.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.23,0:05:17.91,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.93,0:05:18.87,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Stop kidnapping humans!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know the local club hall?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.27,0:05:24.93,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.30,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got special permission from them.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.41,0:05:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a lawful hunter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.26,0:05:31.89,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.38,0:05:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no intention to become your enemy about such a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.30,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to avoid you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not meet again, kitten!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.90,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.22,0:06:05.03,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Daddy, are you all right? Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.17,0:06:06.13,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.70,0:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.05,0:06:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunbathing?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.78,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang the clothes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.89,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Howdy, Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoying sunshine?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some of the good stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever tasted the flavor of life?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.84,0:07:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a sip.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.93,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1414,542)}What's This Taste?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.62,0:08:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.00,0:08:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, what's wrong with Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seemingly there's nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.84,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a fever.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.03,0:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.15,0:08:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits don't catch human illnesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, a cat's body is warmer than a human's.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.08,0:08:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Shanxin?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't come over!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.94,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one question.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.29,0:09:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he yearns for a girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.83,0:09:13.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.11,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to lend you Huang?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.39,0:09:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.70,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You should take him to a vet.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.11,0:09:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we take him to a vet?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.90,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.01,0:09:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, it wouldn't help.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.49,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's drunk...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, come quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.48,0:10:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just Heixius.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.56,0:10:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth..?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's sound asleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just tired?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.23,0:10:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a cup!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll be all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.84,0:11:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No!!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.43,0:11:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.91,0:11:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're up?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.80,0:11:50.66,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Let them go.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will once you feel better.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.81,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get some rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.65,0:11:56.83,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.51,0:12:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.51,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He really got stronger...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.66,0:12:11.54,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.79,0:12:15.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.94,0:12:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.01,0:12:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll release the Heixius then.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.74,0:12:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.82,0:12:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.77,0:12:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.74,0:12:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoohoo, I'm home!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.12,0:12:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't\Nhappen again
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.68,0:14:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.79,0:14:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I must leave now.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have to leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.60,0:14:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you the moment I saw you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.07,0:14:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can transform into a human form!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never thought you could.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not very good at it yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.11,0:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How come your hair is white?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.73,0:14:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, my hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.02,0:15:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be black.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you really are older than Grandpa?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm 10 years old too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When's your birthday?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Around November 1st.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.77,0:15:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger than me. You could be my little brother.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.92,0:15:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Around"?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I was born.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.60,0:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My master picked a day for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're returning to him then?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.16,0:15:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, first I have to finish a quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you will come back sometime?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.60,0:15:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll introduce you to Master later.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the best person in the whole world!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Visit as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.21,0:15:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.82,0:15:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.55,0:15:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei already left.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that he was going to leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.16,0:16:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.04,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He only wanted to stay while he recovered.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.60,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss Dad and Mom a little...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be happy to hear this.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Xiaobai!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.77,0:16:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What??
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.55,0:16:21.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Long time no see
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.55,0:16:21.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We are fine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.55,0:16:21.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're on\Na rollercoaster
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.60,0:16:21.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please don't\Ncall now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.81,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.07,0:16:32.49,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1500,540)}Parting and Reunion
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.11,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Grandpa, I'm going swimming!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.23,0:16:25.73,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.17,0:16:26.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bidiu, come!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.93,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll be back as soon as I can!!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.02,0:16:31.70,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.15,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.40,0:16:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I use the hall's teleport system?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Where do you need to go?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.68,0:16:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting out for your next quest?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.66,0:16:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.86,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. But you don't have to go to Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.13,0:16:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kitten!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How you're doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.39,0:17:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know it's me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.01,0:17:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never seen my human form.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.17,0:17:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course that little girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.98,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it the wrong way!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.41,0:17:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't be in the scope of my hunting permit.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to travel.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go up by myself, Manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.97,0:17:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.37,0:17:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You permit humans getting hunted?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.68,0:17:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's special.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.43,0:17:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Niepa.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a man-eater.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Man-eater?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.27,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even we can't prohibit their kind from hunting.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only restrict their permits to "evil people".
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.08,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who they hunt down must be brought here so we can examine them.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.74,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't they just eat other food?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.29,0:17:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No. They're like blood eaters.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They can only get nutrition from a specific food.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.61,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is to inform them about people on death row and vicious criminals.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.54,0:18:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And conversely:
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if they are hunted down by humans,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't intervene.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you... really do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.38,0:18:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.15,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't deprive them of their right to live.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.51,0:18:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimately,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,they are victims as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.60,0:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only humans,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.26,0:18:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but most spirits also loathe them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But they simply have no choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys just let them hunt humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What other choice is there?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.53,0:18:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we provide their food?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.97,0:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or raise it, the same way humans do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, I met Wuxian in Longyou.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.57,0:18:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in Longyou?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.70,0:18:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he already left.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.82,0:18:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked me to give you your next quest.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.04,0:18:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.31,0:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please read it for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.63,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't forget! Servers start tomorrow at 10.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.74,0:19:04.78,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We can't be late!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, you already told me a thousand times.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.32,0:19:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna revolutionize gaming.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.00,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you'll be hooked on it once you played!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'll be there on time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.50,0:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.78,0:19:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.12,0:19:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.95,0:19:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She just can't stop talking when it comes to games.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.92,0:19:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I don't see Shanxin for days.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.36,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I don't miss her?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.97,0:19:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you know where to find her.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.45,0:19:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, when will Xiaohei return?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He only left a day ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.73,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he's back right away?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.73,0:19:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.09,0:19:44.66,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.59,0:19:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.57,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What goodbye lasts less than one episode?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finished your quest?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.82,0:19:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.18,0:19:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here because of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.82,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:17.49,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:22.23,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:26.93,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:33.13,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:39.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:44.08,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:48.76,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:55.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:21:06.60,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:12.02,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:17.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:28.29,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:33.84,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:40.68,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:17.49,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:22.23,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:26.93,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:33.13,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:39.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:44.08,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:48.76,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:55.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:21:06.60,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:12.02,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:17.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:28.29,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:33.84,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:40.68,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
